{"signature": "{\"text\": \"An energy mix means using several different sources of energy. This reduces dependence on one fuel or technology. If gas prices rise or wind speeds fall, other resources can contribute. Energy storage, electricity interconnectors, demand management and flexible generation can help balance supply and demand. The most secure mix depends on cost, geography, emissions, infrastructure and the ability to respond to changes.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 29.232, "words": [["An", 0.102083], ["energy", 0.375541], ["mix", 0.766166], ["means", 1.052625], ["using", 1.326041], ["several", 1.586458], ["different", 1.990125], ["sources", 2.289583], ["of", 2.70625], ["energy.", 2.888541], ["This", 4.283875], ["reduces", 4.635416], ["dependence", 5.117208], ["on", 5.716166], ["one", 5.911458], ["fuel", 6.09375], ["or", 6.380208], ["technology.", 6.5625], ["If", 8.098958], ["gas", 8.372416], ["prices", 8.632833], ["rise", 9.0625], ["or", 9.335958], ["wind", 9.51825], ["speeds", 9.739583], ["fall,", 10.117208], ["other", 10.625], ["resources", 10.885416], ["can", 11.432291], ["contribute.", 11.627625], ["Energy", 13.28125], ["storage,", 13.723958], ["electricity", 14.335958], ["interconnectors,", 15.039083], ["demand", 16.223958], ["management", 16.5495], ["and", 17.200541], ["flexible", 17.34375], ["generation", 17.916666], ["can", 18.515625], ["help", 18.684916], ["balance", 18.958333], ["supply", 19.231791], ["and", 19.6745], ["demand.", 19.83075], ["The", 21.223958], ["most", 21.419291], ["secure", 21.614583], ["mix", 22.01825], ["depends", 22.304708], ["on", 22.682291], ["cost,", 22.890625], ["geography,", 23.58075], ["emissions,", 24.466166], ["infrastructure", 25.325541], ["and", 26.210958], ["the", 26.39325], ["ability", 26.458333], ["to", 27.005208], ["respond", 27.122416], ["to", 27.526041], ["changes.", 27.682291]], "raw": [{"text": "An", "start": 0.102083, "end": 0.297416}, {"text": "ener